      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Web users on knoww.app\n• Chrome extension users on social and news pages\n• Wallet owners connecting Polygon wallets\n• Supported surfaces:\n  X, Reddit, Farcaster, LinkedIn, Discord,\n  editorial pages, crypto/news sites\n• Entry actions:\n  browse markets, inspect whales, search,\n  portfolio views, live events, trade initiation",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Web users on knoww.app\n• Chrome extension users on social and news pages\n• Wallet owners connecting Polygon wallets\n• Supported surfaces:\n  X, Reddit, Farcaster, LinkedIn, Discord,\n  editorial pages, crypto/news sites\n• Entry actions:\n  browse markets, inspect whales, search,\n  portfolio views, live events, trade initiation",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
