      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Next.js App Router on Cloudflare Workers\n\n• `apps/web` packaged through OpenNext\n• SSR + server-cache for home, events, detail pages\n• client hooks + React Query after hydration\n• singleton websocket managers for live odds\n  and sports updates\n• middleware/CSP, observability, image binding\n• Worker config + R2 incremental cache",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Next.js App Router on Cloudflare Workers\n\n• `apps/web` packaged through OpenNext\n• SSR + server-cache for home, events, detail pages\n• client hooks + React Query after hydration\n• singleton websocket managers for live odds\n  and sports updates\n• middleware/CSP, observability, image binding\n• Worker config + R2 incremental cache",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
