      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "MV3 extension split by responsibility\n\n• content scripts detect platforms, extract text,\n  and inject inline UI\n• `page-bridge.ts` discovers page wallets\n• background worker owns messages, tokens,\n  analytics, caches\n• offscreen runtime isolates heavy crypto,\n  CLOB, and trading libraries",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "MV3 extension split by responsibility\n\n• content scripts detect platforms, extract text,\n  and inject inline UI\n• `page-bridge.ts` discovers page wallets\n• background worker owns messages, tokens,\n  analytics, caches\n• offscreen runtime isolates heavy crypto,\n  CLOB, and trading libraries",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
